# NOTE: sdd/tasks/active/ is intentionally TRACKED — worktrees and other
# sessions must see in-flight task files (see CLAUDE.md, "SDD Auto-Commit Rule").
# parrot LLM-wiki state (local retrieval plane)
# NOTE: `.parrot/*` (not `.parrot/`) so the negations below can re-include the
# committed MCP toolkit config — a trailing-slash directory pattern would stop
# git from ever descending into .parrot/.
.parrot/*
!.parrot/mcp-toolkits.yaml
!.parrot/tool-guards.json
# MCP custom local configs (machine-specific absolute paths; see .mcp.json.example)
.mcp.json
.sdd-coder/
# Codex: local config/hooks/rules are machine-specific; only agents are shared
.codex/*
!.codex/
!.codex/agents/
!.codex/agents/*.toml
# navconfig scaffolds an empty plugins/{agents,tools} tree at BASE_DIR on
# import; it is not part of async-notify and must not be tracked.
plugins/
# parrot LLM-wiki state (local retrieval plane)
.parrot/
